stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> OPEN: FL1 fence registered with owner, interim posture and SLA treatment
    OPEN --> SIGNALLED: FL2 watch key fires or a capture attempt yields a candidate
    SIGNALLED --> OPEN: FL3 not the awaited source, or a draft only
    SIGNALLED --> VERIFYING: FL4 candidate captured raw and rendered, hash archived
    VERIFYING --> OPEN: FL5 negative or partial answer, residual instance stays open
    VERIFYING --> CLEARED: FL6 version certified and published through the pipeline
    CLEARED --> IMPLEMENTING: FL7 on-clear work packages start
    IMPLEMENTING --> SHIPPED: FL8 blocked artefacts pass their release gate evidence
    CLEARED --> REOPENED: FL9 corrigendum, withdrawal or retraction
    IMPLEMENTING --> REOPENED: FL9 corrigendum, withdrawal or retraction
    SHIPPED --> REOPENED: FL9 corrigendum, withdrawal or retraction
    REOPENED --> OPEN: FL10 rollback published and instances re-blocked
    OPEN --> DEFERRED: FL11 change control moves the artefact out of v1
    DEFERRED --> OPEN: FL12 re-entry trigger fires and change control re-admits
    SHIPPED --> [*]

